#==========================================================================================================================================
# Bootstrap structure
#==========================================================================================================================================
    Starting bytes of bootable partition:
        Identifier (2 Bytes) - Must be set to 0xF1C4
        Reserved (30 Bytes)

    Kernel first stage block must start at PART_ADDR + 32 and must be 1024 bytes in size.
    Drake loads it at 0x01012000 (DPTBootPartStructure.CODE_LOAD_ADDR).

    Boot sequence: BIOS (0x00000000) -> Drake (the disk's boot area: 0x000000 - 0x3FFFFF, 4 MiB, loaded at
        the RAM start 0x01010000) -> kernel first stage (0x01012000)
